{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-60-1","title":"Psalms 60:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":60,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":60,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 David, complaining to God of former judgment, 4 now upon better hope, prays for deliverance. 6 Comforting himself in God's promises, he craves that help whereon he trusts.</p>\n<p>A.M. 2964. B.C. 1040. (Title.) {Shu-shan-eduth.}Probably a hexachord harp, or lute; for {�iduth} appears to be the same as the Arabic {�od,} a harp or lute; concerning {shushan,} see on Ps 45; 80, titles.</p>\n<p>Michtam. or, a golden Psalm. 59:1; *title when he strove. 2Sa 8:3,12,13; 10:16; 1Ch 18:3,12,13; 19:16-19 valley. 2Ki 14:7; 2Ch 25:11 O God. 10; 44:9; 74:1; 89:38; 108:11; 1Ch 28:9; Ro 11:1,2 scattered. Heb. broken. 59:11; 1Sa 4:10,11,17; 13:6,7,11,19-22; 31:1-7 O turn. 79:9; 89:3,7,19; 85:4; 90:13; La 3:31,32; Zec 10:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-60-2","title":"Psalms 60:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":60,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":60,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>made. 104:32; 114:7; 2Sa 22:8; Job 9:6; Isa 5:25; Jer 4:24; 10:10; Am 8:8 Hab 3:10; Mt 27:51 broken. 89:40; 2Sa 2:8-32; 3:11-14; Isa 7:8; Jer 14:17; 48:38; Hag 2:6,7 heal. 2Ch 7:14; Job 5:18; Isa 30:26; Jer 30:17; La 2:13; Eze 34:16 Ho 6:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-60-3","title":"Psalms 60:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":60,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":60,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>shewed. 71:20; Ne 9:32; Da 9:12 to drink. 75:8; Isa 51:17,22; Jer 25:15; La 4:21; Eze 23:31,32; Hab 2:16 Re 16:19; 18:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-60-4","title":"Psalms 60:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":60,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":60,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>a banner. 20:5; Ex 17:15; So 2:4; Isa 11:12; 49:22; 59:19 because. 12:1,2; 45:4; Isa 59:14,15; Jer 5:1-3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-60-5","title":"Psalms 60:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":60,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":60,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>That. 12; 22:8; 108:6-13; De 7:7,8; 33:3; Mt 3:17; 17:5 save. 17:7; 18:35; 20:6; 74:11; Ex 15:6; Isa 41:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-60-6","title":"Psalms 60:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":60,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":60,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>God. 89:19,35; 108:7-13; 132:11; 2Sa 3:18; 5:2; Jer 23:9; Am 4:2 rejoice. 56:4; 119:162; 2Sa 7:18-20; Lu 1:45-47 divide. Jos 1:6; 2Sa 2:8,9; 5:1-3 Shechem. Ge 12:6 Sichem. Jos 20:7; 24:1,32 valley. Jos 13:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-60-7","title":"Psalms 60:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":60,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":60,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>Gilead. Jos 17:1,5,6; 1Ch 12:19,37 strength. De 33:17; 1Sa 28:2 Judah. Ge 49:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-60-8","title":"Psalms 60:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":60,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":60,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>Moab. 2Sa 8:2; 1Ch 18:1,2 over. Ge 25:23; 27:40; Nu 24:18; 2Sa 8:14; 1Ch 18:13 triumph. or, triumph thou over me (by an irony). 108:9,10; 2Sa 5:17-25; 8:1; 21:15-22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-60-9","title":"Psalms 60:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":60,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":60,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>Who. Jud 1:12,24,25; 1Ch 11:6,17-19 strong city. Heb. city of strength. 2Sa 11:1; 12:26-31</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-60-10","title":"Psalms 60:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":60,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":60,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>Wilt. 20:7; 44:5-9; 118:9,10; Isa 8:17; 12:1,2 hadst. 1; 108:11; Jer 33:24-26 didst. De 1:42; 20:4; Jos 7:12; 10:42; 1Sa 4:6,7,10,11; 1Ch 10:1-14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-60-11","title":"Psalms 60:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":60,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":60,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>Give. 25:22; 130:8 vain. 108:12; 124:1-3; 146:3; Isa 30:7; 31:3 help. Heb. salvation. 62:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-60-12","title":"Psalms 60:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":60,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":60,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>we shall. 18:32-42; 144:1; Nu 24:18,19; Jos 1:9; 14:12; 2Sa 10:12; 1Ch 19:13 tread. 44:5; Isa 10:6; 63:3; Zec 10:5; Mal 4:3; Re 19:15</p>"}]}